# Each part of the platform has its own environment file. Copy the one you need:
#
#   backend/.env.example     -> backend/.env      (API, MongoDB, auth, email, Paystack, storage, automation key)
#   frontend/.env.example    -> frontend/.env     (API URL, site URL, Google Analytics, Search Console)
#   automation/.env.example  -> automation/.env   (API URL, automation key, report delivery)
#
# Never commit real .env files. They are listed in .gitignore.
